  },
  {
   "id": "F17",
   "path": "sections.story.2",
   "category": "interpretation_label",
   "severity": "fix",
   "problem": "「这一折返是全篇的转折」/'the pivot of the whole story' 是作者判断，写在 record 段里，没有标签。",
