   "proposed": "加'作者认为'/'In the author's reading'。"
  },
  {
   "id": "F18",
   "path": "sections.story.2",
   "category": "parity",
   "severity": "fix",
   "problem": "英文 'the retainers squandered besides' 与原文「尚安事客」和中文「还要门客何用」意思不同。",
