  {
   "id": "F19",
   "path": "sections.story.2",
   "category": "inner_life",
   "severity": "fix",
   "problem": "英文 'he had counted on exactly this' 写成侯生有意设计。原文只说「以是知」，即他由此料知。",
   "evidence": [
