  {
   "id": "F22",
   "path": "sections.story.3",
   "category": "quotes",
   "severity": "fix",
   "problem": "英文引号 'she had no way to repay him' 误译「顧未有路耳」，'repay' 是添加的意思，而且用引号冒充原文。",
   "evidence": [
    {
     "id": "SJ0771-E15",
     "quote": "顧未有路耳"
